вующим в этих местах. Миллер не остановится ни перед чем, чтобы вернуть то, что ему принадлежит.","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1572715","ru":"Lost and Found","en":"Lost and Found","year":"2025","type":"Фильм","rating":10.0,"votes":4,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/5JnT5ITtVznfq30k3BBrCZ0vWMO.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iDuAJ1EaNE9OPs0pJ5IDjlTrtP5.jpg","genres":["Драма","Музыка"],"overview":"О маленьком мальчике, который однажды на пороге своего дома находит маленького пингвина. Мальчику становится жалко своего гостя, и он решает помочь пингвину вернуться обратно домой. Прежде чем они доберутся до Южного полюса, им предстоит пройти немало испытаний…","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1427540","ru":"Free at Heart","en":"Free at Heart","year":"2025","type":"Фильм","rating":10.0,"votes":4,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/o3AQLEPNkdeib4Men0WSNs1ELIy.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2nH7Enpai65oTZoEJGQ57mWmSpg.jpg","genres":["Драма","Семейный","Мелодрама"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1377455","ru":"Shutterspeed","en":"Shutterspeed","year":"2025","type":"Фильм","rating":10.0,"votes":4,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/dmCPux38aIcOiVoQF8k2kC7NLqk.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uffTWESXIoyhDonrDI1lwelga8f.jpg","genres":["Драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1648813","ru":"Bandage Poetry","en":"Bandage Poetry","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":10.0,"votes":4,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/xUVl9Y4ZkOxpGMSYcJRAwcvMM51.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xJTobJxDLIp7CoTVGPufwUQmyHY.jpg","genres":["Драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1556599","ru":"Nicolaj Lange - Halvvejs","en":"Nicolaj Lange